---
const faqs = [
  {
    question: "¿Cuánto tiempo tarda en entregar un proyecto?",
    answer: "El tiempo de entrega depende de la complejidad. Una Landing Page suele estar lista en 1-2 semanas, mientras que plataformas más complejas pueden tomar de 4 a 8 semanas."
  },
  {
    question: "¿Qué métodos de pago aceptan?",
    answer: "Aceptamos transferencias bancarias, pagos con tarjeta mediante plataformas seguras y criptomonedas (USDT/BTC)."
  },
  {
    question: "¿Ofrecen soporte técnico después de la entrega?",
    answer: "Sí, todos nuestros proyectos incluyen un periodo de soporte post-entrega para resolver dudas y asegurar el correcto funcionamiento."
  },
  {
    question: "¿Tienen garantía en sus proyectos?",
    answer: "Absolutamente. Ofrecemos garantía técnica sobre el desarrollo original para asegurar que tu inversión esté 100% protegida."
  }
];
---
<section class="about-corporate" id="conoce-mas">
  <div class="container">
    <!-- Main About Content (From Image) -->
    <div class="about-main reveal">
      <div class="about-visual">
        <div class="nexus-container">
          <div class="nexus-core">
            <div class="core-aura"></div>
            <div class="core-shell">
              <div class="core-shimmer"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="core-inner">
              <div class="core-nucleus"></div>
              <div class="core-ring"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="core-glow"></div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="orbit-ring r1"></div>
          <div class="orbit-ring r2"></div>
          <div class="orbit-ring r3"></div>

          <div class="floating-point p1 glass">
            <span class="icon">✨</span>
            <span class="label">Innovación</span>
          </div>
          <div class="floating-point p2 glass">
            <span class="icon">💎</span>
            <span class="label">Calidad</span>
          </div>
          <div class="floating-point p3 glass">
            <span class="icon">🚀</span>
            <span class="label">Escalabilidad</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-text">
        <span class="badge-outline">NUESTRA EMPRESA</span>
        <h2>CRSoftware <br/> <span class="gradient-text-hero">Corporation</span></h2>
        <p>
          En CRSoftware Corporation somos una empresa dedicada al desarrollo de soluciones digitales innovadoras y modernas. Nos especializamos en la creación de páginas web profesionales, diseñadas para ayudar a negocios, emprendimientos y empresas a fortalecer su presencia en internet.
        </p>
        <p>
          Nuestro objetivo es combinar creatividad, tecnología y compromiso para ofrecer proyectos de calidad, adaptados a las necesidades de cada cliente. Buscamos expandir nuestros servicios hacia sistemas ERP, aplicaciones móviles y software empresarial.
        </p>


        <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-gradient">Trabajemos juntos <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mission & Vision Section -->
    <div class="mission-vision-grid reveal">
      <div class="mv-card glass">
        <div class="mv-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Nuestra Misión</h3>
        <p>Empoderar a empresas y emprendedores a través de tecnología de vanguardia, creando soluciones digitales que impulsan su crecimiento y eficiencia en el mercado global.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mv-card glass">
        <div class="mv-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z"></path><path d="M12 15l-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z"></path><path d="M9 12H4s.5-1 1-4c2 1 2 1 4 4z"></path><path d="M12 15v5s1-.5 4-1c-1-2-1-2-4-4z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Nuestra Visión</h3>
        <p>Convertirnos en el aliado tecnológico líder a nivel internacional, siendo reconocidos por nuestra innovación constante y la excelencia técnica en cada proyecto de software.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- What Differentiates Us -->
    <div class="differentiation reveal">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="gradient-text-hero">VALOR AGREGADO</span>
        <h2>¿Qué nos diferencia?</h2>
      </div>
      
      <div class="diff-grid">
        <div class="diff-item">
          <div class="diff-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364-6.364l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707m0-11.314l.707.707m11.314 11.314l.707-.707M12 8a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h4>Diseño Centrado en el Usuario</h4>
          <p>No solo creamos código, diseñamos experiencias que tus clientes amarán usar.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="diff-item">
          <div class="diff-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#06b6d4" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"></rect><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"></rect><line x1="9" y1="1" x2="9" y2="4"></line><line x1="15" y1="1" x2="15" y2="4"></line><line x1="9" y1="20" x2="9" y2="23"></line><line x1="15" y1="20" x2="15" y2="23"></line><line x1="20" y1="9" x2="23" y2="9"></line><line x1="20" y1="15" x2="23" y2="15"></line><line x1="1" y1="9" x2="4" y2="9"></line><line x1="1" y1="15" x2="4" y2="15"></line></svg>
          </div>
          <h4>Tecnología de Punta</h4>
          <p>Utilizamos las herramientas más modernas (React, Node, Astro) para garantizar velocidad y seguridad.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="diff-item">
          <div class="diff-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h4>Compromiso Total</h4>
          <p>Tu éxito es el nuestro. Ofrecemos soporte y asesoría constante en cada etapa del desarrollo.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <div class="faq-section reveal">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="badge-faq">FAQ</span>
        <h2>Preguntas <span class="gradient-text-hero">frecuentes</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-grid">
        {faqs.map((faq) => (
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>{faq.question}</span>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="arrow-icon"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>{faq.answer}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const faqItems = document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item');
  faqItems.forEach(item => {
    const question = item.querySelector('.faq-question');
    question?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      // Close other items
      faqItems.forEach(otherItem => {
        if (otherItem !== item) otherItem.classList.remove('active');
      });
      item.classList.toggle('active');
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .about-corporate {
    padding: 100px 0;
    background: #020617;
  }

  /* Main About Layout */
  .about-main {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 6rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 8rem;
  }

  .about-visual {
    position: relative;
    height: 500px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .nexus-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    perspective: 1200px;
  }

  .nexus-core {
    position: relative;
    width: 160px;
    height: 160px;
    z-index: 10;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .core-shell {
    position: absolute;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    box-shadow: 
      inset 0 0 20px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2),
      0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    z-index: 5;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .core-shimmer {
    position: absolute;
    top: -50%;
    left: -50%;
    width: 200%;
    height: 200%;
    background: linear-gradient(
      45deg,
      transparent 45%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 50%,
      transparent 55%
    );
    animation: shimmer-core 3s infinite linear;
  }

  .core-inner {
    position: relative;
    width: 70%;
    height: 70%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, #4f46e5, #0ea5e9);
    border-radius: 50%;
    z-index: 3;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.6);
    animation: 
      pulse-nexus 4s ease-in-out infinite,
      rotate-core-3d 12s linear infinite;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
  }

  .core-inner::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
    background-image: 
      linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 15px 15px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .core-nucleus {
    width: 30%;
    height: 30%;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(2px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px white;
    animation: pulse-nucleus 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .core-ring {
    position: absolute;
    width: 125%;
    height: 125%;
    border: 2px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: rotate-core-ring 15s linear infinite;
  }

  .core-aura {
    position: absolute;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: expand-aura 3s ease-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes shimmer-core {
    0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
    100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  @keyframes rotate-core-ring {
    from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  @keyframes expand-aura {
    0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.8; }
    100% { transform: scale(2); opacity: 0; }
  }

  .core-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -20%;
    left: -20%;
    width: 140%;
    height: 140%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3) 0%, transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(20px);
    animation: glow-nexus 4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .orbit-ring {
    position: absolute;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 50%;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
  }

  .r1 { width: 280px; height: 280px; animation: rotate-nexus 20s linear infinite; }
  .r2 { width: 360px; height: 360px; animation: rotate-nexus 30s linear infinite reverse; transform: rotateX(70deg); }
  .r3 { width: 440px; height: 440px; animation: rotate-nexus 40s linear infinite; transform: rotateY(70deg); }

  .floating-point {
    position: absolute;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: white;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    z-index: 20;
    box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .p1 { top: 10%; right: 15%; animation: float-point 6s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .p2 { bottom: 15%; left: 10%; animation: float-point 7s ease-in-out infinite 1s; }
  .p3 { top: 50%; left: -5%; animation: float-point 8s ease-in-out infinite 2s; }

  @keyframes pulse-nexus {
    0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); filter: brightness(1); }
    50% { transform: scale(1.08); filter: brightness(1.3); }
  }

  @keyframes glow-nexus {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(1); }
    50% { opacity: 0.7; transform: scale(1.15); }
  }

  @keyframes rotate-nexus {
    from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  @keyframes rotate-core-3d {
    from { transform: rotateY(0deg) rotateX(0deg); }
    to { transform: rotateY(360deg) rotateX(20deg); }
  }

  @keyframes float-point {
    0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
    50% { transform: translate(-15px, -25px); }
  }

  /* About Text */
  .about-text h2 {
    font-size: 4rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    color: white;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .gradient-text-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #06b6d4);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .about-text p {
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .btn-gradient {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #06b6d4);
    color: white !important;
    padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .btn-gradient:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
  }

  .arrow {
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .btn-gradient:hover .arrow {
    transform: translateX(5px);
  }

  /* Mission & Vision */
  .mission-vision-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 8rem;
  }

  .mv-card {
    padding: 3rem;
    text-align: left;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .mv-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    border-color: var(--primary);
  }

  .mv-icon {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
  }

  .mv-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .mv-card p {
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Differentiation */
  .differentiation {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .diff-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .diff-item {
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-radius: 24px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .diff-item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.08);
    border-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .diff-icon {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
  }

  .diff-item h4 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .diff-item p {
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }


  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .about-main { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4rem; text-align: center; }
    .about-visual { height: 400px; }
    .mission-vision-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .diff-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about-text h2 { font-size: 3rem; }
    .tech-base-container { display: none; }
  }

  /* FAQ Styles */
  .faq-section {
    margin-top: 8rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .badge-faq {
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1);
    color: #a855f7;
    padding: 0.4rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .faq-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .faq-item {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .faq-question {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1.8rem 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: white;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .faq-question:hover {
    color: #a855f7;
    padding-left: 0.5rem;
  }

  .arrow-icon {
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    color: #a855f7;
  }

  .faq-item.active .arrow-icon {
    transform: rotate(90deg);
  }

  .faq-answer {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .faq-item.active .faq-answer {
    max-height: 200px;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .faq-answer p {
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .faq-question { font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .faq-section h2 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
  }
</style>
